        "# Dataloader\n",
        "For this part, we will start by building a custom dataloaders that inherts from the `ImageFolder` object from `torchvision`. Since the training process for the two different loss functions treated in the problem take in different input modes (a pair of images for contrastive loss, a triplet of images for triplet loss), you are asked to use two different dataloaders.\n",
