        "`PairLoader`is completed for you already; it forms pairs of two images in the dataset, which can be from the same dog or different dogs. During training, the `__getitem__` function is called and it returns an anchor image, a comparison image, and a value indicating whether they are from the same dog (1 for yes, 0 for no).\n",
        "\n",
        "You are tasked to complete `TripletLoader`, which should load triplets, that is, three images where the first image is the anchor image, the second is a positive case (i.e., from the same dog), and the third is a negative case (i.e. from a different dog)."
